<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 73.0671 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 73.0671 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 73.0671 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday from 73.4336 on Thursdy.</p>
<p>				    Dec 20		  Dec 19</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  73.0671		 73.4336</p>
<p>    volume ($ mln)	     5.265		   3.005</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	    47.3333		 47.5424</p>
<p>    volume (DM mln)	    0.030		   0.190</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom,  + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
